  "rationale": "The four blocked steps cut every path to crownData:exfiltrate. Blocking configSecret stops ssoLogin (AND) and one route to jumpHost. Blocking sshKey stops dbLogin and vpnSession (both AND), so jumpHost, fileServer (via dbLogin), printServer (via vpnSession), localAdmin and serviceAccount are unreachable. Blocking memoryDump stops rdpLogin (AND), so fileServer and hypervisor are unreachable. Blocking apiToken leaves appServer with no reachable parent (memoryDump, apiToken and ssoLogin are all out), so secretsManager is also unreachable. As a result vaultRead, codeRepo, shareMount and dbReplica all have no reachable parent, and the target cannot be reached."
